%% D4a: the car's hardware and signal path
flowchart TB
  L[SICK 2D LiDAR] -->|scans| J[NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano<br/>runs all the software]
  J -->|speed command| V[VESC motor controller<br/>speed mode]
  V -->|wheel speed, IMU| J
  V -->|its own speed loop<br/>sets motor current| MOT[Brushless motor]
  J -->|steering command| V
  V -->|servo position| SV[Steering servo]
